@startuml CryptoWeb-05-uc05-browse-public-market-news
title CryptoWeb - UC05 - Browse Public Dashboard, Market and News

!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam activityFontSize 13
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam nodesep 45
skinparam ranksep 45

|Public Browser|
start
:Open public Dashboard, Market or News page;
|Market and News Services|
:Fetch market symbols and available live prices;
if (Price data available?) then (yes)
  :Return market summaries;
else (no)
  :Return partial or unavailable market state;
endif
|Public Browser|
if (Select cryptocurrency?) then (yes)
  :Choose asset and candle interval;
  |Market and News Services|
  :Validate symbol and interval;
  :Retrieve stored candles or provider candles;
  |Public Browser|
  :View candlestick chart or no-data message;
endif
if (Open News?) then (yes)
  |Market and News Services|
  :Retrieve available articles;
  |Public Browser|
  :View news list or unavailable state;
endif
note right
  Public browsing does not require
  authentication or KYC.
end note
stop
@enduml
